<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- JNPT cargoes - Feb 14.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- JNPT cargoes - Feb 14.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's JNPT port on February 14:</p>
<p> Commodity	   Tons		   Ship		 Berthing</p>
<p>		(LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Urea	     1,050  (ULD)  4,020    Antios		02/02</p>
<p>Wheat	    8,658  (ULD) 21,468    Hargobind	   12/02</p>
<p>Molasses	 2,521  (ULD)  5,202    Marqueen	    10/02</p>
<p>Roza	     3,901  (ULD)  1,746    Edible Oil	  13/02</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note: LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co - JNPT)</p>
